{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"markov cluster algorithm markov cluster algorithm","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","fileName":"Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Markov Cluster Algorithm","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-14 21:34\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Network and Uncertain Data Clustering]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network and Uncertain Data Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"markov cluster algorithm markov cluster algorithm","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","fileName":"Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Markov Cluster Algorithm","heading":"Markov Cluster Algorithm","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"The Markov Cluster Algorithm simulates flow on a graph by alternating expansion and inflation of a stochastic matrix. Expansion spreads transition probability along longer paths, while inflation strengthens high-probability flows and suppresses weak ones.\n\nRepeated operations separate regions in which random walks circulate readily. The inflation parameter controls granularity: stronger inflation tends to produce more and smaller communities.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Network and Uncertain Data Clustering","dataclustering.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Markov Cluster Algorithm.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSear